 ("D3", "Window colour in the After", "All new and remaining windows, the utility door and the bi-folds anthracite RAL 7016 outside / white inside, matching your five owner windows (the drawings say 'to match existing', which in 2022 meant white).", "Anthracite outside, white inside."),
 ("D4", "Sun for the stills", "Front exterior stills and matched checks use the filmed morning sun (SE, 22 deg) so they match your photos; rear and interior stills use your 'sunny afternoon' (SW, 25 deg, 16:00), which floods the new kitchen-diner through the bi-folds.", "Use both, as specified."),
 ("D5", "Loft", "Build the loft from the Quest scan later; in v1 only its rooflights show outside. The rear rooflight is assumed the same size as the front one, mirrored on the rear slope.", "Agree; confirm one rear rooflight (or send one photo of the back roof)."),
 ("D6", "Back garden", "Nothing behind the house was photographed. Placeholder: lawn, fences at the drawn heights, a 3 m porcelain patio outside the extension (After) and a small patio outside the conservatory (Before).", "Best: send 6 phone photos of the back garden and the back of the house (10 minutes) before the build; otherwise approve the placeholder."),
 ("D7", "Before interiors", "No photos of the current rooms exist, so the Before is furnished in the same style (unchanged rooms identical in Before and After, so the comparison shows the building) and the existing kitchen, cloaks and conservatory are shown as typical (white shaker kitchen, white suites).", "Agree, or send one photo per room to make the Before your real interior."),
 ("D8", "Fix known garden faults in the first build", "Fix the four measured faults inside the house build (street hedge as 3 blocks, lawn colour, gravel contrast, paving blend) plus No.21's porch and the chimney pots; leave the apple tree and pergola as modelled.", "Fix those six now."),
 ("D9", "What stays out", "Kept: bins, benches, pots, bird table, ornaments, wall fittings. Left out: bike, scooter, toys, broom, pumpkins, cars.", "Agree."),
 ("D10", "Budget and rounds", "One Unreal build run for all stills + a 60 s film per version, capped at GBP 3 of the GBP 10 whole-house cap; one judge round and one fix round before you see it.", "Approve GBP 3 cap."),
